---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';import Map from '../components/Map.astro';import {places} from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Quranic Places Atlas"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Geography with its sources attached</span><h1>{learning.heading}</h1><p>Explore fifteen place references. Follow modern map contexts where evidence supports them, and read unpinned entries without guessing a location.</p></section><section class="panel panel-body"><Map/></section><section class="panel top-gap bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Find a place<input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="Makkah, Midian, Sinai…"/></label><label class="field">Location evidence<select id="category"><option value="">All entries</option>{[...new Set(places.map(p=>p.kind))].map(k=><option>{k}</option>)}</select></label><label><input id="saved-only" type="checkbox"/> Saved only</label><button class="button secondary" id="export">Copy saved reading list</button><span id="count" class="micro" aria-live="polite"></span></div></section><div class="card-grid">{places.map(p=><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={p.id} data-category={p.kind}><span class="eyebrow">{p.kind}</span><h2><a data-reading-link={p.id} href={`/place/${p.id}/`}>{p.name}</a></h2><p>{p.summary}</p><span class="micro">Quran {p.passage.ref}</span><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/place/${p.id}/`}>Open entry ↗</a><button class="button secondary" data-save={p.id} aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button></div></article>)}</div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><h2>No places match</h2><p>Try another name or change the evidence filter.</p></div><script>import '../lib/library';</script></Shell>
